# The image's own entries for what starts by itself (PERSISTENCE in /etc/amethystora/security.conf): files in
# the folders the audit log watches that change in ordinary use and start nothing, recorded and not said. The
# machine's own are in /etc/amethystora/allow.d/persistence (ame security allow persistence PATH). A glob each;
# ~/ is every home folder. These are exact paths: a rename onto authorized_keys is still said.
#
# The hosts SSH has met, which it adds to on every new one
~/.ssh/known_hosts
~/.ssh/known_hosts.old
